   154	|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
   155	| R1 | E1 | T2 | 211^2 | 1 | 0 after the cusp | OREV-MISS; else OPEN | Lemma 2.3; G3/G4/ONE-NODE do not apply |
   156	| R2 | E1 | T3path | 211^3 | 1 | -1 | OREV-SAFE (cusp overfills leftover 0) | Lemma 2.2 plus Chau Lemma 4.3 |
   157	| R3 | E1 | T3star | 211^3 | 1 | -1 | OREV-SAFE | same as R2 |
   158	| R4 | E2 | T2 | 211^2 | 1 | 1 | OREV-MISS; else OPEN | Lemma 2.3 |
   159	| R5 | E2 | T3path | 211^3 | 1 | 0 | OREV-MISS; else OPEN | Lemma 2.3; leftover saturated with no unibranch |
   160	| R6 | E2 | T3star | 211^3 | 1 | 0 | OREV-MISS; else OPEN | Lemma 2.3 |
